  "description": "Gyani Maiya Sen-Kusunda (1937–2020), a community elder from Dang, Nepal, names parts of the body in Kusunda in a conversation with Uday Raj Aaley. Subhashish Panigrahi recorded it in 2018 for his 2019 documentary Gyani Maiya. The footage wasn't used in the film, and it was edited and published under the Gejmehac Gipan project in 2024. Nepali subtitles are by Aaley, and the English subtitles are by Panigrahi with Aaley's help.",
